# OPERATOR STATE. `make pi-ship` does not overwrite the copy on the Pi
# (PI_OWNED in the Makefile). git holds only the seed for a fresh
# install. Edit on the Pi: `sudo pf tui`, Agent lists, then apply.
#
# Public IPv4 addresses or CIDRs that the agent segment may reach on TCP
# 22. Empty means closed. This is the default: all other TCP 22 packets
# from an agent segment are dropped.
#
# SSH goes fully around the fence. A listed host is a raw tunnel:
# `ssh -D/-L/-R`, ProxyJump and remote commands all skip the resolver
# gate, the domain lists and the strip. It is also a path for each key
# that the agent has. Use a forge front door, not a shell that you
# administer. Git should continue to use https.
